{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457950/extras/efb8644367088a90c3d1883473f92535.poster.avif?t=1773405254\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457950/extras/efb8644367088a90c3d1883473f92535.webm?t=1773405254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457950/extras/efb8644367088a90c3d1883473f92535.mp4?t=1773405254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457950/extras/3522287ff90b62e66bc6fb022645683f.avif?t=1773405254\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the captivating world of Warpswap, a puzzle-platformer where teleportation and swapping blocks are your ultimate tools! Embark on an epic journey across a unique pixel-art planet, featuring 5 distinct locations, each with its own unique atmosphere and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From frosty mountains to scorching volcanoes, master your swapping abilities to solve over 70 intricately designed levels. Discover hidden secrets, overcome tricky puzzles, and immerse yourself in a story of adventure and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457950/extras/6c3612b108db4fca150debb89e2273cf.avif?t=1773405254\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2125, a lone explorer crash-lands on a lost planet, becoming the first human to set foot on its surface. Struggling to survive and find a way home, they discover a mysterious artifact that grants the power to swap places with objects. Using this newfound ability, they must solve the planet\u2019s secrets and overcome its challenges to send a distress signal and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457950/extras/87a30233307b65f6e9a87da2affd51bd.poster.avif?t=1773405254\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457950/extras/87a30233307b65f6e9a87da2affd51bd.webm?t=1773405254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457950/extras/87a30233307b65f6e9a87da2affd51bd.mp4?t=1773405254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>5 Diverse Bioms</strong>: From serene snowy landscapes to fiery volcanic depths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Beautiful pixel art</strong>: A vibrant world brought to life with meticulous detail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Over 70 levels</strong>: Challenging puzzles and platforming to keep you hooked. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Unique mechanics</strong>: Swap places with blocks to navigate and solve challenges. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3457950?t=1773405254","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773405254","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457950/4ee696bc70af7b386038768c361a299710753dc3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773405254","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457950/4ee696bc70af7b386038768c361a299710753dc3/capsule_184x69.jpg